Why this idea stands out in a hackathon 
This isn't just a "property record app." It combines digital document management, rental 
management, financial tracking, AI-powered search, reminders, analytics, and secure 
family sharing into a single platform tailored for Indian households. It addresses a widespread, 
real-world pain point with clear potential for future integration with government services like 
DigiLocker and land record portals, making it both practical and scalable.
